# Multi-Environment AWS API Gateway & CloudWatch Log Groups with Terraform Workspaces

## Overview
Provisioned isolated `dev` and `prod` environments for multiple AWS API Gateway REST APIs and matching CloudWatch Log Groups using Terraform workspaces, the `count` meta-argument, and `local-exec` provisioners for resource creation auditing.

## Architecture & Resource Mapping
| Workspace | API Gateway REST API | CloudWatch Log Group | Audit Log Files |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `dev` | `dev-datacenter-api-1` | `/aws/apigateway/dev-datacenter-api-1` | `apigateway.log`, `loggroups.log` |
| `dev` | `dev-datacenter-api-2` | `/aws/apigateway/dev-datacenter-api-2` | `apigateway.log`, `loggroups.log` |
| `prod` | `prod-datacenter-api-1` | `/aws/apigateway/prod-datacenter-api-1` | `apigateway.log`, `loggroups.log` |
| `prod` | `prod-datacenter-api-2` | `/aws/apigateway/prod-datacenter-api-2` | `apigateway.log`, `loggroups.log` |

## Key Implementation Details
- **Terraform Workspaces (`dev` & `prod`):** Used `terraform.workspace` interpolation to prefix API Gateway and CloudWatch Log Group names dynamically while maintaining isolated state files under `terraform.tfstate.d/`.
- **`count` Meta-Argument:** Iterated over `var.KKE_API_NAMES` (`["datacenter-api-1", "datacenter-api-2"]`) to provision matching API Gateways and CloudWatch Log Groups dynamically.
- **`local-exec` Provisioners:** Logged creation confirmations to `/home/bob/terraform/apigateway.log` and `/home/bob/terraform/loggroups.log` upon resource creation.
- **Workspace Outputs:** Exposed `kke_api_gateway_names` and `kke_log_group_names` via splat expressions (`[*]`) across both workspaces.

## Terraform Configuration Files

### `variables.tf`
```hcl
variable "KKE_API_NAMES" {
  description = "Names of API Gateways to create"
  type        = list(string)
}
```

### `terraform.tfvars`
```hcl
KKE_API_NAMES = ["datacenter-api-1", "datacenter-api-2"]
```

### `main.tf`
```hcl
resource "aws_api_gateway_rest_api" "api" {
  count = length(var.KKE_API_NAMES)
  name  = "${terraform.workspace}-${var.KKE_API_NAMES[count.index]}"

  provisioner "local-exec" {
    command = "echo 'Created API Gateway ${self.name} in workspace${terraform.workspace}' >> /home/bob/terraform/apigateway.log"
  }
}

resource "aws_cloudwatch_log_group" "api_logs" {
  count = length(var.KKE_API_NAMES)
  name  = "/aws/apigateway/${terraform.workspace}-${var.KKE_API_NAMES[count.index]}"

  provisioner "local-exec" {
    command = "echo 'Created Log Group ${self.name} in workspace${terraform.workspace}' >> /home/bob/terraform/loggroups.log"
  }
}
```

### `outputs.tf`
```hcl
output "kke_api_gateway_names" {
  value = aws_api_gateway_rest_api.api[*].name
}

output "kke_log_group_names" {
  value = aws_cloudwatch_log_group.api_logs[*].name
}
```

