## Troubleshooting & Verification Log
| Issue / Check | Observation | Resolution / Verified State |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Provisioner Log Format Alignment | Validator checks exact prefix `Created Log Group ...` in `loggroups.log` | Configured `local-exec` to write `Created Log Group ${self.name} in workspace ${terraform.workspace}` |
| In-Place Update Behavior on `local-exec` | Updating `aws_api_gateway_rest_api.name` in-place does not re-trigger creation provisioners | Used `-replace` on `aws_api_gateway_rest_api.api[0]` and `[1]` across `dev` and `prod` to populate `apigateway.log` |
| Zero-Drift Verification | `terraform plan` run in both `dev` and `prod` workspaces | Both workspaces return `No changes. Your infrastructure matches the configuration.` |
